      "promise": "Eloise has been asked to deliver Mrs. Halloway's lunch and silver brooch to Mrs. Halloway's sister; the reader is owed that delivery's outcome.",
      "quote": "\"Eloise, darling, would you take this lunch to my sister? And would you mind giving her my silver brooch? It’s... meant to find its way home.\"",
